      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having this be a seperate paramiter Check box on the Paramiters menu would be best!\n\nThis would stop players from breaking avatars that perhaps have systems or animations on them that \"use up\" a toggle or animation, else players could just reset it back to when they had it.\n\nSo having this be an extra check box here would be great and allow better control for avatar creator's avatars!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
