      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This 100% this. Tons of people love to customize their avatars, and switch between looks. A way to make switching between configurations on the fly easier would be great. Though as other's have said, This should be an additional setting per parameter in the parameters file in the SDK as to prevent breaking certain other aspects of the avatar.",
