      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62def591a3b0fa44be058bab|full_name}, Having it just save all parameters that are \"Saved\" would likely be fine. Since those are usually the ones that matter?\n\nI guess there will be weird exceptions, such as that weird \"knife loot box\" avatar prefab I have seen a few times. But those are more the exception than the rule, so something along the lines of a \"Save independently of looks\" options would likely be nice to have for that. But it would still be a disruptive SDK change no matter how it is implemented.",
